    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Lands Coolroe, Graiguenamanagh, Co. Kilkenny, \r\n\r\nc.5.07 ha - c. 15.52 acres \r\n\r\nFor Sale by Live Virtual Online & Public Auction\r\n\r\nWednesday 9th of September 2026. \r\n\r\nAt\r\n\r\nWilsons Auctions, Kingswood Interchange, Naas Road, Dublin 22\r\n\r\nGood Location \r\n\r\nLocation Graiguenmanagh 2.5km, Thomastown 12km, New Ross 20km, Kilkenny 28km. \r\n\r\nThe lands are located off a minor road, accessed from L4209, 2.5km west of Graiguenamanagh town. Population (2022) 1,506. It is a town on the River Barrow in Co Kilkenny. Graiguenamanagh is located at the foot of Brandon Hill & is home to Duiske Abbey. The Barrow's aquatic facilities include boating, fishing, swimming, kayaking, and canoeing. Graiguenamanagh provides a wide range of services and facilities, to include schools, shopping, restaurants & sporting clubs. Kilkenny city is a 30-minute drive, where most amenities and transport links can be found. Graiguenamanagh is a wonderful place for locals and tourists alike.\r\n\r\nDescription KK29020F, KK30562F\r\n\r\nThe lands are contained within folio KK29020F, KK30562F and amount to c.5.07 ha - c. 15.52 acres. The subject lands are in one irregular shaped block. They are laid out in large manageable divisions, with mature boundaries, of hedging, trees in part. The lands on an elated site, currently in grass of good quality. They contain, gallops, stables, turnout paddocks and associated equestrian facilities. \r\n\r\nIdeal location for a one-off house, subject to the necessary planning. \r\n\r\nThe lands are being sold as seen and not subject to planning.\r\n\r\nCoordinates: 52.545548, -6.991250\r\n\r\nViewing - By appointment \r\n\r\nSolicitor Conor Kavanagh, MDM Solicitors, 16 Lavitt's Quay, Centre, Cork. \r\n\r\nVAT Refer to legal contracts."
      },
      {
